OL,3,CBuck Moon: How to see July's full moon
OL,5,FThe Buck Moon is the traditional name
OL,6,Fgiven to July's full moon. It takes
OL,7,Fits name from the time of year when
OL,8,Fmale deer, or bucks, begin growing a
OL,9,Ffresh set of antlers. The antlers are
OL,10,Finitially covered in a soft layer of
OL,11,Fvelvet before hardening later in the
OL,12,Fsummer.
OL,14,FThe name is one of several seasonal
OL,15,Ffull moon titles passed down through
OL,16,FNative American traditions and later
OL,17,Fadopted into popular calendars. Other
OL,18,Fcultures have their own names for
OL,19,FJuly's full moon, often linked to
OL,20,Fseasonal changes, harvests or weather.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
