OL,3,CBuck Moon: How to see July's full moon
OL,5,FWill we see the Buck Moon?
OL,7,FYes ` provided the skies are clear.
OL,8,FThe Buck Moon will be visible across
OL,9,Fthe UK and many other parts of the
OL,10,Fworld, although cloud cover could
OL,11,Faffect the view in some locations.
OL,12,FIt's been clearly visible the last few
OL,13,Fevenings and nights - but we do have
OL,14,Fshort nighttime hours this time of
OL,15,Fyear, particularly further north -
OL,16,Fsuch as the Northern Isles of Scotland.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/5
