OL,3,CBuck Moon: How to see July's full moon
OL,5,FEven if you miss the exact moment the
OL,6,Fmoon becomes full, it will appear
OL,7,Falmost full on the nights immediately
OL,8,Fbefore and after dark, giving
OL,9,Fskywatchers several chances to enjoy
OL,10,Fthe spectacle.
OL,12,FWhen is the best time to see it?
OL,14,FFor the most impressive view, head
OL,15,Foutside shortly after sunset and look
OL,16,Ftowards the eastern horizon as the
OL,17,Fmoon rises. This is when it often
OL,18,Fappears larger and more golden in
OL,19,Fcolour because of the well-known "moon
OL,20,Fillusion", even though the moon itself
OL,21,Fhasn't changed in size.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/5
