OL,3,CBuck Moon: How to see July's full moon
OL,5,FIf possible, choose a location away
OL,6,Ffrom bright streetlights with an
OL,7,Funinterrupted view of the horizon to
OL,8,Fget the best experience.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/5
